THE FLOW

                                            app-secret
                                                │
                                                ├── DB_USERNAME
                                                └── DB_PASSWORD
                                                      │
                                                      ↓
                                               secretKeyRef
                                                      │
                                                      ↓
                                                   Pod
                                                      │
                                                      ↓
                                                 Environment
                                                      │
                                                 ┌────┴─────┐
                                                 ↓          ↓
                                            DB_USERNAME  DB_PASSWORD


- The Pod doesn't directly read the Secret YAML file.
- Instead:
      Secret object -> Kubernetes API -> Pod references Secret -> Container receives the value

